## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

Lavender Heart retains cardamom as La Nuit's opening recognizer, then resolves it into three lavender registers: Bontaux floral-honeyed body, High Altitude fine aromatic lift, and a small Spike camphor edge. Linalool and linalyl acetate continue the aromatic chemistry into literal cedar without a barbershop, laundry, or sweet-fougère turn. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-04.json`.

